# The MiniLM embedding artifact is bundled with the submission so dense
# retrieval works when the organiser loads the catalogue in a fresh runtime.
# Rebuild with `python3 -m scripts.build_embeddings` only when the catalogue or
# selected model changes.
#
# bge-small is NOT bundled: that model line stopped by team decision (E1), and
# its .npy is 73 MB. Keep it local. Ignored because a `git add -A` once swept
# it into a P4 commit and the history had to be rewritten to get it back out.
data/embeddings/bge-small-en-v1.5.*
